<title>POLAND: POLISH KPW CLEARS PEKPOL REGISTERED SHARES.</title>
<headline>POLISH KPW CLEARS PEKPOL REGISTERED SHARES.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Securities Commission (KPW) cleared Polish food producer Pekpol SA 488,400 registered preferred shares for public trade, KPW said in a statement.</p>
<p>Pekpol has 1,320,000 shares outstanding including the registered shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
